<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31854" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκδηλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆλος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>conspicuous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵν᾽ ἔ. μετὰ πᾶσιν Ἀργείοισι
					γένοιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.2
				</span></i>
			 : hence, <i>considerable,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου μοῖρα</span>
			<u>CPHerm.</u>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				6.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>quite plain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντ᾽ ἐποίησεν ἔκδηλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					2.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				665.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, etc.: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδηλοτάτη ἐνάργεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1251.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως</span>”
				<i>openly, manifestly, plainly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vit.</u>
					p.40J.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Oth.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.625d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				15.192a
			</span></i> : 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				19.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				60.3
			</span></i>.</div>
